<title>FINLAND: Aamulehti jumps on MTV merger news.</title>
<headline>Aamulehti jumps on MTV merger news.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish media group Aamulehti-yhtyma Oy rose sharply following news that it planned to merge with commercial television company MTV Oy, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1130/0830 GMT, Aamulehti traded at 185.00 markka, up 30.50 markka or almost ten percent.</p>
<p>Turnover was moderate.</p>
<p>&quot;This is extremely good news for Aamulehti -- it will secure the company's position as a media major in Finland,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuter.fi</p>
</text>
